  "body": "Positioned in one of Orewa's most desirable beach side pockets, this beautifully crafted residence enjoys an enviable setting just metres from the beachfront. Recently largely rebuilt and fully renovated, it combines contemporary style, exceptional quality and relaxed coastal living in a package perfectly suited to permanent residence, an easy-care holiday retreat or a secure lock-and-leave lifestyle.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed to embrace its seaside surroundings, the home showcases striking Nu-Wall cladding chosen for both its modern appearance and durability in the coastal environment. Every aspect of the layout has been carefully considered to maximise natural light, sea views and effortless indoor-outdoor connection. Crisp, light-filled interiors are complemented by sophisticated dark accents, while expansive glazing frames ever-changing ocean outlook and welcomes the sunshine throughout the day.\r\n\r\nThe heart of the home is the open-plan living and dining area, where doors extend seamlessly to an expansive front deck offering captivating sea views of Orewa Beach and the sparkling waters beyond. At the centre, the well-appointed kitchen is designed for both entertaining and everyday life, featuring a Belling oven, generous island bench and plentiful storage. From here, living extends naturally to a spacious, private rear deck complete with a large auto louvre system, creating the perfect setting for relaxed gatherings with family and friends.\r\n\r\nPrivately positioned away from the main living areas, the master suite provides a peaceful retreat with its own deck, walk-in wardrobe and elegant ensuite. Upstairs is perfect for family or visitors to have their own space. Two further large bedrooms opening to a spacious deck with lovely sea views and a stylish family bathroom. \r\n\r\nPracticality is well catered for with a separate laundry and internal-access double garage located on the lower level. There is ample off-street parking with room for a campervan or boat, a garden shed and lots of storage.\r\n\r\nNestled at the end of tightly held Puriri Avenue, this exclusive and peaceful beachside cul-de-sac offers a lifestyle few can rival. Step out your door and be on the sand within moments, while Orewa's vibrant cafés, restaurants, shops and amenities are all within an easy flat walk. For commuters or weekend adventurers, motorway access is conveniently close at hand.\r\n\r\nOur vendors are reluctantly leaving this special property to be closer to family.\r\n\r\nWake to the sound of the waves, enjoy the beach as your backyard, and embrace the very best of coastal Orewa living.",
